            <title>0.2.10</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:31:27 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://nfarina.github.io/brushy</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/nfarina/brushy/releases/tag/v0.2.10</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>12</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.10</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's new

- Pasted and placed images now appear in the middle of what you're looking at, instead of the middle of the canvas, so you can always see what you just pasted when you're zoomed in.
]]></description>
