        <item>
            <title>0.2.9</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 09:24:46 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://nfarina.github.io/brushy</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/nfarina/brushy/releases/tag/v0.2.9</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>11</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.9</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's new

- Painting, filling or running a gradient on a paint layer that was enlarged (by Image Size or Free Transform) no longer comes out blurry. The layer is resampled to canvas resolution first, as its own undo step.
- Selection outlines (marching ants) are now crisp at every zoom level, instead of blurring between screen pixels.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/nfarina/brushy/releases/download/v0.2.9/Brushy-macos.zip" length="5795584" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="ULxcLGXM4fvRIclD1Y5saH29cH0WBabYZipL+UsgT98Pm/Bve18WpX7xGwNI7huNp5MnltOGohYOQkrdjvRwBg=="/>
        </item>
